Package: pistor
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.10),
         python3-gpiozero,
         python3-lgpio
Description: PWM fan control daemon for the piStor Raspberry Pi 5 NAS
 piStor is a NAS-style build around a Raspberry Pi 5 and a Radxa Penta Hat.
 This package provides the pistord systemd service, which reads the CPU
 temperature and drives a PWM fan on GPIO 13, either automatically or from
 a temperature/speed table in /etc/pistor.conf.
